# The grey orchards: its most characteristic ground from above at noon, then
# over the shoulder at noon, at the sprayers' evening circuit, and turned.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_orchards.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
hour 11
place typical_grey_orchards
wait 3.0
shot orchards-above with land:grey_orchards
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot orchards-noon with land:grey_orchards
mouse 600,0 0.6
wait 0.8
shot orchards-noon-turned with land:grey_orchards
hour 19.2
wait 2.0
shot orchards-evening with land:grey_orchards
